			<div class="content" id="post-content-4851378">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> The SCP is a humanoid entity similar to SCP-096, being tall, disproportionate, and skinny. The SCP can produce any sound at any volume at any location, as long as it's heard it before. There are also two other parts of the SCP. The village it came from is the first, it's an endless maze of houses and shops, some buildings being made of obscure materials, including glass, wires, and human components. The other part of the SCP are people who have seen the entity through photography or video. The go crazy a few hours after seeing the image or video, and kill any living thing they see, but can't die themselves.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> After reports came that an entire village had been wiped out, the foundation investigated, and found the entity in the forest near by, and brought it into containment. They also discovered the anomalous effects of the village. Then, after taking pictures of the SCP, and showing them to a few people, those people went crazy, and those anomalous effects were discovered.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The physical description, and the ability of the entity grabs attention, as it's very obscure and slightly scary. The description and ability of the village and the crazy people also add to it, as they are also pretty freaky, and generally disturbing. It may not be extremely significant, but it adds as a whole to the scp world.</p>

							</div>

								
					
